### @name PasswordLogin
POST {{rootUrl}}/auth/login
# Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
{
	"email": "admin@example.com",
	"password": "password@123-local"
}

### @name PasswordRegister
POST {{rootUrl}}/auth/register
# Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
{
	"email": "staff-admin@example.com",
	"password": "ChangeMe123!@3#lol"
}

### @name GetVerificationLink
GET {{rootUrl}}/auth/verification-link?userId=123

### @name GetTenantAuthData
GET {{rootUrl}}/auth/tenant-auth-data

### @name GetRedirectCode
GET {{rootUrl}}/auth/redirect-code?tenantId=123
